{
 "id": "west-body-vo-01",
 "model_prefs": [
  "eleven_v4"
 ],
 "items": [
  {
   "name": "N01",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "1865年7月20日晚，密苏里州，斯普林菲尔德。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N02",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "一家旅馆里，两个老朋友在打牌。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N03",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "一个是北军侦察兵，比尔·希科克。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N04",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "一个是南军老兵，戴维斯·塔特。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N05",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "仗刚打完，两人还坐在同一张桌上。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N06",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "为了一笔赌债，两人吵了起来。"
  },
  {
   "name": "T07",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.4,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.55
   },
   "text": "你欠我三十五块。"
  },
  {
   "name": "H08",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.4,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.55
   },
   "text": "是二十五。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N09",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "差了十块钱。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N10",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "塔特一把抓起希科克的金怀表。"
  },
  {
   "name": "T11",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.4,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.55
   },
   "text": "钱还清之前，表归我。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N12",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "他还放话：明天要戴着这块表，走过广场。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N13",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "当众戴别人的表，就是当众羞辱他。"
  },
  {
   "name": "H14",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.4,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.55
   },
   "text": "你敢戴着它走过广场，我就杀了你。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N15",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "第二天傍晚六点，广场上的人突然散开了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N16",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "希科克在广场一头等着。塔特，走了进来。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N17",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "两人相隔大约六十九米，差不多大半个足球场。"
  },
  {
   "name": "H18",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WkcRFJo38X9XEP8kGExm",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.4,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.55
   },
   "text": "戴夫，别过来！"
  },
  {
   "name": "N19",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "据说，塔特先拔枪开了火。没打中。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N20",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "希科克把枪架在手臂上，扣下了扳机。"
  },
  {
   "name": "T21",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "lt7GBaCoAHWbT7JSZ5Xs",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.4,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.55
   },
   "text": "兄弟们，我中枪了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N22",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "他倒在了法院门口。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N23",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "希科克被控过失杀人。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N24",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "塔特的枪里，少了一发子弹。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N25",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "陪审团没讨论多久，就判他无罪。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N26",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "可一桩街头枪杀，怎么就成了传奇？"
  },
  {
   "name": "N27",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "1867年，哈珀斯杂志把他写成了无所畏惧的英雄。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N28",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "同一年，有报道说，他杀过一百个人。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N29",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "廉价小说一本接一本。后来，好莱坞把它拍成了你开头看到的样子："
  },
  {
   "name": "N30",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "近在咫尺，四目相对，谁快谁活。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N31",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "而斯普林菲尔德这一枪，被称为西部的第一场对决。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N32",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "可故事还没完。2026年2月，当地翻出了一批旧档案。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N33",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "希科克站的位置，可能比传说中近得多。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N34",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "连那六十九米，也可能是传说。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N35",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "十一年后，1876年，达科他的一家酒馆。希科克又坐上了牌桌。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N36",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "这一次，有人从背后开了枪。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N37",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "他手里的牌：两张黑A，两张黑8。后来被叫作，死人之手。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N38",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "一场牌局开始了他的传奇，另一场牌局结束了它。"
  },
  {
   "name": "N39",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.4
   },
   "text": "为了十块钱和一块表，你会走进那个广场吗？"
  }
 ]
}